{"name":"Maarlith","status":"ok","title":"Maarlith","pageId":145863,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Maarlith</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TSS.M_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TSS.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dambrath\" title=\"Dambrath\">Dambrath</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Maarlith</b> was a small town located in the nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Dambrath\" title=\"Dambrath\">Dambrath</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South\" title=\"Shining South\">Shining South</a> during the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TSS.M_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TSS.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Maarlith?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Maarlith was located in central Dambrath in the southern reaches of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rialuil_Plain\" title=\"Rialuil Plain\">Rialuil Plain</a> on the northern coast of the <a href=\"/wiki/Bay_of_Dancing_Dolphins\" title=\"Bay of Dancing Dolphins\">Bay of Dancing Dolphins</a>. The town lay at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Trader%27s_Road\" title=\"Trader's Road\">Trader's Road</a> southwest of <a href=\"/wiki/Cathyr\" title=\"Cathyr\">Cathyr</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TSS.M_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TSS.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracke